// S-709: the function of another module first, then the `use` of `process_inplace` of the flow that does not have
// it. The E0304 is on the later `use`; that `use` has an error of the names stage, so the types stage does not
// report it again as E0302.
use dsp.other.{process_inplace}
use dsp.synth.one.{process_inplace}                 //~ E0304
